    "id": "superexam-pharmacology-0034",
    "subject": "pharmacology",
    "originalNumber": 34,
    "stem": "A 17-year-old girl sees her physician for swollen\nlymph nodes in the supraclavicular region. A core\nbiopsy demonstrates Reed–Sternberg cells and\nfibrotic bands, a finding characteristic of nodular\nsclerosis Hodgkin disease. Which of the following\ncombined regimens might be used in this patient?",
