    "originalNumber": 36,
    "stem": "A 74-year-old woman who is undergoing\nchemotherapy for advanced lung cancer presents to\nthe infusion center for her next treatment. Before\neach treatment her white count, emoglobin, and\nplatelet counts are checked to make sure she is not\nexperiencing chemotherapy-related cytotoxicity. Her\nblood sample is run in the analyzer, and her platelet\ncount is reported to be at a dangerously low level.\nWhich medication is her oncologist likely to prescribe\nin this situation, along with a platelet transfusion?",
