    "id": "superexam-pharmacology-0038",
    "subject": "pharmacology",
    "originalNumber": 38,
    "stem": "A 30-year-old woman has suffered from cyclical\nmigraines for many years. She now presents to her\nphysician asking for a medication designated\nspecifically for migraines, not just a general pain\nreliever. Her physician decided to prescribe\nsumatriptan as a trial medication. The patient, who is\na biochemist, would like to know how this medication\nworks.",
