    "subject": "pharmacology",
    "originalNumber": 40,
    "stem": "A 55-year-old woman is admitted to the surgical\nintensive care unit after having a coronary artery\nbypass grafting of four of her coronary vessels.\nOvernight she develops hypotension, and her cardiac\noutput, as measured by the Swan-Ganz catheter, is\nsignificantly lower than it had been postsurgery. You\ndecide to give her a dose of milrinone. This results in\nan increase in her cardiac output. How does\nmilrinone work?",
