    "stem": "A 70 year old male who is diagnosed with Colon\nCancer Stage IV with metastasis to the liver who is\ncurrently on FOLFOX regimen was started on a\nmonoclonal antibody which binds to the vascular\nendothelial growth factor (VEGF) receptor. What is\nthe medication that was given to the patient?",
