    "explanation": "Imatinib is a tyosine kinase inhibitor used in CML.\nSorafenib inhibit multiple tyrosne kinase receptors\nand are primarily used in HCC. Trastuzumab inhibits\ncells that overexpress the Her-2/neu recepto in\nBreast CA. Erlotinib inhibits epidermal growth factor\nreceptor and is used for non small cell lung CA and\npancreatic cancer",
