    "stem": "A 34/F asthmatic, scheduled to undergo\ncholelithiasis, was being induced by the\nanesthesiologist. After starting the volatile anesthetic,\nthe anesthesiologist noted increased peak air\npressure, prolonged expiration with the classic \"shark\nfin\" capnograph. Which of the following most likely\nhave caused the above findings?",
