    "stem": "A 50/M is about to be given 6-mercaptopurine for his\nulcerative colitis as an off-label use. The patient has\nmultiple comorbidities which include hypertension,\ndiabetes, asthma and gout and takes losartan,\nmetformin, salmeterol, allopurinol and diclofenac for\nthese conditions. Which of the above drugs would\nprompt you to rethink the dose of 6-MP that you are\nabout to administer?",
