    "subject": "pharmacology",
    "originalNumber": 375,
    "stem": "A 21/M presented with recurrent fever, night sweats,\nenlarged abdomen and generalized\nlymphadenopathy. Biopsy of a lymph node showed\nReed-Sternberg cells. Which of the following\nchemotherapeutic regimen/s can be given to the\npatient?",
