    "subject": "pharmacology",
    "originalNumber": 503,
    "stem": "Loca is a 23 year old G4P4 (4004) who has been on\noral contraceptives for 8 months now. What is the\nexpected drug-drug interaction If she was to start on\nan anti-tuberculosis drug that acts by inhibitting RNA\nsynthesis and which imparts orange color to urine\nand sweat?",
