    "stem": "A 33-year old farmer, after 1 hour of spraying\ninsecticides, started to note generalized body\nweakness, drowsiness, shortness of breath, numbness\nand severe epigastric pain. After 10 hours, he was\nbrought to the ER due to loss of consciousness. He\nwas soaking in sweat, drooling with saliva and\ndiarrheic. What should be administered to this\npatient?",
