    "stem": "Baby B. Ulate, suffers from infestation of the “unholy\ntrinity” of roundworms, namely Ascaris lumbricoides,\nTrichuris trichiura and Ancylostoma duodenale. What\nis the mechanism of action of the drug suitable for the\npatient’s condition?",
